{
  "info": {
    "name": "auth-service",
    "description": "Registro, login y consulta de los datos públicos de usuarios del auth-service. Orden sugerido: carpeta 1 (flujo feliz) → carpeta 2 (errores) → carpeta 3 (salud). El alta genera un email único por corrida y devuelve AuthResponse (user + token JWT); guarda el id en {{userId}} y el token en {{authToken}}. El login reutiliza ese email, devuelve otro AuthResponse y actualiza {{authToken}}; GET /me lo usa como Bearer. Los tokens de los ejemplos son marcadores, no credenciales reales.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Flujo feliz",
      "description": "Alta de usuario y consulta del usuario recién creado. Ejecutar en orden: el alta guarda {{userId}}, {{userEmail}} y {{authToken}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Registra un usuario con nombre, email y contraseña. El email se normaliza (trim y minúsculas) y debe ser único; la contraseña se guarda solo como hash BCrypt. Responde 201 con AuthResponse: perfil público en user y JWT HS256 en token. Respuestas: 201 usuario creado, 400 datos inválidos, 409 email ya registrado, 500 error interno. El email se genera con la marca de tiempo para poder repetir la corrida."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', 'ana.' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve AuthResponse con user y token', () => { pm.expect(body).to.have.all.keys('user', 'token'); });",
                  "pm.test('devuelve el id del usuario', () => pm.expect(body.user.id).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('devuelve el email registrado', () => pm.expect(body.user.email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userEmail')));",
                  "pm.test('incluye createdAt', () => pm.expect(body.user.createdAt).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('devuelve un JWT con tres segmentos', () => { pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; pm.expect(body.token.split('.')).to.have.lengthOf(3); });",
                  "pm.test('no expone la contraseña ni su hash', () => { pm.expect(body.password).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.passwordHash).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.user.password).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.user.passwordHash).to.be.undefined; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 - usuario creado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "users"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n  \"email\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"6710f3a2c9e77c0012345678\",\n    \"name\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n    \"email\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-22T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Verifica el email normalizado y la contraseña contra el hash BCrypt. Responde 200 con AuthResponse: perfil público en user y JWT HS256 en token. Las credenciales incorrectas responden 401 UNAUTHORIZED sin revelar si el email existe. Ejecutar después de 'Registrar usuario' para reutilizar {{userEmail}} y {{userId}}; guarda el nuevo JWT en {{authToken}}."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve AuthResponse con user y token', () => { pm.expect(body).to.have.all.keys('user', 'token'); });",
                  "pm.test('devuelve el mismo usuario del alta', () => pm.expect(body.user.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userId')));",
                  "pm.test('devuelve un JWT con tres segmentos', () => { pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; pm.expect(body.token.split('.')).to.have.lengthOf(3); });",
                  "pm.test('no expone la contraseña ni su hash', () => { pm.expect(body.password).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.passwordHash).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.user.password).to.be.undefined; pm.expect(body.user.passwordHash).to.be.undefined; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - sesión iniciada",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "auth",
                    "login"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"6710f3a2c9e77c0012345678\",\n    \"name\": \"Ana Pérez\",\n    \"email\": \"ana.perez@example.com\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-22T10:00:00Z\"\n  },\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
